
DialogID_76202=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since you have entered the pavilion, there is no need to be so restrained.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am about to fetch some water from the fountain of youth, and you can drink it with me later.</font>
DialogID_76203=During the Jin Dynasty, Du Yu developed the art of tea ceremony, which reached its peak during the Tang Dynasty. However, it has gradually declined nowadays. To make a cup of high-quality tea, the tea leaves must be finely ground into powder and then steeped in spring water from the tea kettle on the brazier. The tea is then stirred with a special bamboo whisk until the foam overflows, and the liquid is poured into a tea bowl to be consumed. The first cup of tea is considered the best, known as "junyong," and each subsequent cup is of decreasing quality.
DialogID_76204=(Upon closer examination) "As it is first made, the foam rises and becomes like accumulated snow, shining like a spring blanket." It seems that you have already memorized the way of tea... Speaking of which, it has been ten years since my junior brother has tasted my tea... (Stunned for a moment) Alright, you may leave now.
DialogID_76207=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We must thank you for keeping the Tatars and the Ming people safe from war. I </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >have important matters to attend to, so I must bid farewell to you here!</font>
DialogID_76209=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >zzzZZz…zzZZZzzzz...</font>
DialogID_76210=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >zzzZZz…zzZZZzzzz...</font>
DialogID_76212=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you are ready, you can set off immediately!</font>
DialogID_76216=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Are you from Kunlun?</font>
DialogID_76217=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Open the package.</font>
DialogID_76218=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There may be some misunderstandings. Give this item to me. You should return to your sect first!</font>
DialogID_76220=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Collect Kunlun Ice Spring.</font>
DialogID_76221=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Collect</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Kunlun Jade</font>
DialogID_76222=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Collect</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Snow Chrysanthemum</font>
DialogID_76223=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Collect Snow Lotus.</font>
DialogID_76234=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Everything is at the peak of Kunlun, so if you have the ability, you can go and try it out.</font>
DialogID_76235=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You're back so soon?!</font>
DialogID_76236=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The environment at the mountaintop is harsh. If you can sit here quietly, you will surpass me. I will then acknowledge your strength!</font>
DialogID_76238=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You must be the young person that the elder mentioned! However, you still need to meet our requirements to enter the Tianya Haige!</font>
DialogID_76239=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Dig up the dirt pile.</font>
DialogID_76245=<font face="Default" color="#f90c43" >Unconscious...</font>
DialogID_76246=<font face="Default" color="#f90c43" >Unconscious...</font>
DialogID_76247=<font face="Default" color="#f90c43" >Unconscious...</font>
DialogID_76248=<font face="Default" color="#f90c43" >Unconscious...</font>
QiecuoMenu_76203=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I hope your skills are as strong as your mouth!</font>
QiecuoMenu_76205=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since you are so eager to meet, I will let you meet me!</font>
QiecuoTitle_76203=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Although you may be a bit foolish, you are not a coward. Good! I will use 30% of my strength to test you!</font>
QiecuoTitle_76205=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I advise you to mind your own business! Have you ever seen a fist the size of a sand pot?</font>
