okmenu_76202=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Let me take care of it.</font>
okmenu_76203=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >will remember</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
okmenu_76204=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Very well, I'll see you there.</font>
okmenu_76207=Third Prince, take care and see you soon.
okmenu_76209=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Try putting in two different types of stones.</font>
okmenu_76210=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Put in two types of stones.</font>
okmenu_76212=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Good! </font>
okmenu_76216=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are correct.</font>
okmenu_76217=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Confirm</font>
okmenu_76218=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Good.</font>
okmenu_76220=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure</font>
okmenu_76221=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure</font>
okmenu_76222=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure</font>
okmenu_76223=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure</font>
okmenu_76234=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Good! </font>
okmenu_76235=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >All the items are collected. Take a look.</font>
okmenu_76236=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well, it's a deal! </font>
okmenu_76238=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Join Tianya Haige</font>
okmenu_76239=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure</font>
okmenu_76245=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Looks like this is the boatman.</font>
okmenu_76246=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This girl is unconscious... </font><font face="Default" color="#f90421" >(glances to the side)</font>
okmenu_76247=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Girl, girl! </font><font face="Default" color="#ff0220" >(it seems that this girl on the ship has completely lost consciousness)</font>
okmenu_76248=<font face="Default" color="#fc0521" >(lost in thought)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > girl</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > has also fainted. They all seem to be from wealthy families, judging by their luxurious clothing.</font>
story_76203_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tianyou Island is a peaceful paradise, with crystal clear waters and a pleasant climate all year round.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >However, over a hundred years ago, it was a run-down fishing village where the locals lived simple lives and fished for a living. On the island, there is a spring that never ages, and it is said that those who drink from it can become young again and maintain their youth forever.</font>
story_76203_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am a descendant of the fishermen who were born and raised on Tianyou Island.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As a child, I was always curious about the outside world and at the age of sixteen, I left on a merchant ship to explore the world. Through a series of fortunate events, I became an apprentice and have since achieved some success. Upon returning to my homeland, I established the Tianya Haige (End of the World Seagull) Pavilion.</font>
story_76203_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As long as you do not disturb others, you are free to live as you please in the pavilion.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You should go and pay your respects to the two elders first.</font>
story_76204_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You seem unfamiliar, are you a new disciple?</font>
story_76204_2=<font face="Default" color="#e0184d" >(with a look of resentment, frowning) </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have disturbed my clear thoughts...</font>
story_76204_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am Yunhen, and you</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > must have heard about the miraculous effects of the Fountain of Youth. People on Tianyou Island are difficult to determine their true age. To be honest, I am already over seventy years old.</font>
story_76205_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Are you a new disciple?</font>
story_76205_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since I joined the Tianya Haige, I have been focusing on studying medicine. As the saying goes, a person's character is reflected in their medical skills. If you join the Tianya Haige, I have a few words to share with you.</font>
story_76205_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The way of Yin and Yang is a principle that both heaven and humans must follow, and cannot deviate from. First, everything requires caution and cannot be reckless. Second, be decisive when faced with situations and do not miss opportunities. Third, be upright and fair, and do not be tempted by fame and fortune.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Fourth, be good at adapting and do not waste time waiting. Do you understand the underlying meaning?</font>
story_76206_1=<font face="Default" color="#fc021b" >(Out of breath)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Just now, at the coast, a disciple found a stranded boat!</font>
story_76207_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Could it be a shipwreck? Quickly take some people and go check it out on the shore.</font>
story_76208_1=<font face="Default" color="#f90e45" >(There are four unconscious people near the stranded boat)</font>
story_76209_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Instruct the disciples to bring them back to the pavilion for treatment. If they have encountered a shipwreck, they may have swallowed a lot of seawater. If they also have a high fever, it could be very dangerous and they will need some medicine stones for treatment.</font>
story_76210_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >After taking the medicine, their bodies should be fine. If they wake up later, we should ask about their origins.</font>
story_76211_1=<font face="Default" color="#fc0a22" >(Looking terrified and speaking in an unfamiliar language)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, Dok#￥%#￥……%￥@#￥@Agasi@!￥#%#￥</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >……&*#￥%</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
story_76212_1=<font face="Default" color="#fc021f" >（Gesturing excitedly and muttering something under her breath）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oni</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >@#！@%￥……&￥**￥Hajima@#￥！@@#！……</font>
story_76213_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My name is Jade Rabbit, and they...are my</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >good</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >sisters, Gold Pearl and Silver Pearl. The three of us were traveling by boat from Jinling to the South Sea for leisure, but unexpectedly encountered a big storm...</font>
story_76214_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It is a joy to have friends come from afar! It has been a long time since we had any guests at the pavilion, so why don't we hold a grand banquet for these friends who have escaped death?</font>
story_76214_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It is strange that wealthy families from the Central Plains would not leave their homes and come to the South Sea alone. We should keep this matter quiet and have our attendants secretly investigate.</font>
story_76215_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, Doc...&*!~%￥#</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oni</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...&@!!*&*&...%*&</font>
story_76216_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ade ￥%*&！Wu #￥%&#@！</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Chingu</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >*￥%……%￥%…&%#￥%￥</font>
story_76217_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ah, thanks for your concern</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, I'm fine now.</font>
story_76218_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff051e" >(casually look at you, but suddenly pupils dilate and stare at the jade rabbit, then quickly look away, expression returning to normal)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Who... is she?</font>
story_76219_1=<font face="Default" color="#f90421" >(Silver Fang clenches teeth)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Who was that</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >woman just now?</font>
story_76220_1=<font face="Default" color="#f7021f" >(Stranded ship)</font>
story_76221_1=<font face="Default" color="#fc052a" >(Silver Pearl can't understand what you're saying,</font><font face="Default" color="#f90c4b" >looks at Gold Pearl, and</font><font face="Default" color="#ea044d" >starts</font><font face="Default" color="#fc052a" >covering her face and crying)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wuwuwuwu...</font>
story_76222_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You seem rushed, what happened?</font>
story_76222_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's unbelievable...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Elder Yunhen is not Han Chinese, she was born into a noble family of the Tatars, and later went to the Central Plains to learn martial arts with the leader... Later, she followed the leader and joined the Tianya Haige.</font>
story_76223_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >But it doesn't matter.</font>
story_76223_2=<font face="Default" color="#ff0228" >(Extremely shocked)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >In the Tatar language, "tu lai" means rabbit, could it be that Miss Yutu is the Princess Tu Lai!</font>
story_76223_3=<font face="Default" color="#fc0213" >(Serious and anxious)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is not good, we must immediately report this to the leader!</font>
story_76224_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young man, stay calm, there is no hot tofu for you to eat here.</font>
story_76224_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Solving the problem requires finding the person who tied the bell, since the root of the issue lies with the princess in the picture. Simply return the princess to Jinling as soon as possible, and all misunderstandings will be resolved...</font>
story_76225_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young man,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the Tartars have no intention of fighting with the Ming court again,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >we are willing to offer ten thousand fat sheep from the grasslands as tribute, and send a princess to marry into the court. As for Tula, let the</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Emperor of Ming</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >decide, we don't care about killing and mutilating!</font>
story_76225_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young man, don't worry!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have informed General Huang of the cause and effect,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >as long as Tianya Haige hands over Princess Tula and the Goryeo tribute women to us,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >we can guarantee no trouble.</font>
story_76226_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > (After a moment of contemplation)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >First, bring Princess Tula here.</font>
story_76227_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Spare</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tula, I will take responsibility for her</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >crimes</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >as well.</font>
story_76227_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Not bad.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >She was abandoned by me as soon as she was born. Now I have taken her place and repaid this debt.</font>
story_76228_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have a good heart, young hero. However, since the battle plan has already been leaked, even if it is retrieved, it will only be a useless piece of paper. The Ministry of War will reorganize and purge from within, to prevent such incidents from happening again at the root.</font>
story_76228_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now, the actions of Princess Tulan have nothing to do with the Third Prince. Since she has already taken her own life and the Tatars are willing to establish friendly relations with our Ming Dynasty, this matter will be handled discreetly. Those who are unaware at Tianya Haige will not be held accountable, and I will report to the Emperor.</font>
story_76229_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The matter has been resolved so quickly?!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The battle plan has not yet been retrieved and returned to the court...</font>
story_76229_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So that's how it is, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >thankfully everything turned out fine... </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I can see you hesitating, is there still something on your mind? </font>
story_76229_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...Back then, Qingchuan, Yunhen and I </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >were all students of the same school, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the three of us were like siblings </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and we were close friends for life. </font>
story_76229_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It was good, but at that time we were young and arrogant, only seeking our own happiness and ignoring the feelings of others.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I had a deep admiration for Senior Sister Qingchuan</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, but I didn't know that Senior Sister Yunhen had feelings for me</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >……</font>
story_76230_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That night</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, the three of us met at the beach as usual to play the zither and recite poetry, and then we saw the unforgettable</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Dragon City Mirage</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >……</font>
story_76230_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That night, the sky was bright and the night was like day. Above the clouds, there were immortals playing the zither and dancing. Later on, the thousands of raindrops fell into the sea like golden threads, and the sky quickly returned to darkness. Along the coast, a blue light strip shimmered like the Milky Way, making the three of us feel like we were in a fairyland...</font>
story_76230_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That night, Yunhen took the opportunity to express her feelings, but I was at a loss and rejected her on the spot. Her prideful nature couldn't handle this humiliation, so she left in a huff... Qinchuan and I thought she would come back once she had thought things through, but before we knew it, more than ten years had passed. When she returned to her hometown after more than ten years, she had completely changed. She was no longer the respectable woman who was cold on the outside but warm on the inside. Instead, she exuded a sinister aura.</font>
story_76230_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >After she left, Qingchuan blamed me for being too impulsive. The two of us searched all over the world for her whereabouts. It wasn't until later that we found out she had returned to the Tartars, regained her noble status, and became the Khan's favorite concubine. We respected her choice and returned to Tianyou Island. Qingchuan and I decided to put aside our personal feelings and be good friends, guarding the ends of the earth together.</font>
story_76230_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now, Senior Sister Yunhen is experiencing the pain of losing her daughter. Qingchuan and I cannot disturb her...</font>
story_76231_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sigh, another poor girl has died! It reminds me of a girl on the island many years ago... She also died tragically and was buried here.</font>
story_76231_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >When Tianyou Island was still just a small fishing village, there was a girl named Wang Zhenzhu. Her father went out to sea for business and had not returned for many years. After Zhenzhu's mother passed away, she longed day and night to be reunited with her father. Later, she boarded a merchant ship bound for the Central Plains in search of her father, but encountered pirates... The villagers were saddened to hear of Zhenzhu's tragic fate and helped to build a tomb for her.</font>
story_76231_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That child</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >suffered</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >when</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >one day, a nameless volcano erupted near the Tianyou Island, and at night</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, the sky was as bright as day. Along the shore</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >were fish flashing with</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >blue light, constantly jumping</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >. But</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >before long, they all died and were washed back into the sea by the waves.</font>
story_76232_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What joy is there in life, what pain is there in death, if one understands all this, there will be no more fear.</font>
story_76232_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Unresolved feelings...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The mirage of Dragon City</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, ha ha, it's not that easy. If only that moment had never happened, perhaps the three of us would still have the same feelings until now.</font>
story_76232_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't joke...</font>
story_76233_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Is she...still safe?</font>
story_76233_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is a celestial phenomenon, how can it be recreated by humans? Your strategy of delaying the battle is useless against a woman like her.</font>
story_76233_3=<font face="Default" color="#ff002e" >(Thinking left and right, feel that you are not very reliable)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How about we try a different approach and hold a memorial service for her...</font>
story_76234_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hey there</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, I overheard your conversation with the master outside the palace.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have such courage, I am impressed with you!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's just the Dragon City Mirage, what do you need me to do, just ask!</font>
story_76234_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hmm...I have a general idea of the location and it shouldn't be difficult to figure out the eruption frequency. Oh, on one side of our island, there are many strange stones with a golden sheen, perhaps influenced by the volcano.</font>
story_76234_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The oldest person living on the island is Grandma Rong, you can go and ask her about the stones.</font>
story_76235_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Let me think...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Back then, a fleet passed by Tianyou Island and Pearl begged them to take</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >her</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >to the mainland. The merchant ships were filled with silver stones, seemingly precious minerals mined nearby.</font>
story_76236_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >With a sly look, tell me</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >what do you want to ask?</font>
story_76236_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This stone is extraordinary, when it encounters fire, it will melt and produce a large amount of golden mist. What's even more peculiar is that these stones emit a silver-blue light at night.</font>
story_76237_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...How did you do it?</font>
story_76240_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have been studying for some time now, and your recent performance has been excellent. You have grown into a young talent who can stand on your own!</font>
story_76240_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have recently had some realizations and need to go into seclusion for a while. Kunlun is where the dragon veins are located, so we must not let anything happen! During my seclusion, you must carefully patrol the entire Kunlun with your fellow disciples!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you encounter any problems, you can seek advice from your eldest senior brother, Cao Yi'an.</font>
story_76241_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Recently, I heard from a junior disciple on patrol that a group of suspicious people suddenly appeared at the foot of the mountain.</font>
story_76241_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hold on! Don't act rashly until we have investigated the situation!</font>
story_76241_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >First, go down the mountain carefully and investigate. If there is a conflict, even if you are not strong enough, you can still retreat safely! Remember, do not be reckless!</font>
story_76242_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Huh? Did Yunyangzi send you?</font>
story_76242_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Is Yunyangzi teaching his disciples like this? Can anyone just take things without anyone guarding them?</font>
story_76243_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This matter is a long story. After you left, I carefully asked the junior brother, and the description of the stranger's appearance was very similar to the portrait of my martial brother Wang Haifu that the sect leader showed me.</font>
story_76244_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Fu Hai has already told me about your situation, and it's considered that we have met. In the future, you must not act recklessly!</font>
story_76244_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hahaha, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you don't know. Fu Hai was originally from the South Sea, born into poverty and suffered at the hands of pirates since childhood. As he grew up, he worked hard to learn martial arts and gathered a group of brothers to fight against the invading pirates at sea, protecting the safety and interests of fishermen and merchants, and earning the respect of the people along the southeast coast.</font>
story_76244_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He was quite clever.</font>
story_76244_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thinking back to the past, Fu Hai and his close friend, the leader of Tianya Haige, Youyou Jun, traveled to Kunlun together for leisure, but encountered an </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >avalanche</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > in the mountains. Coincidentally, their teacher was also in the mountains, observing the snow and gaining enlightenment. Together, they resolved this disaster without harm.</font>
story_76244_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well done!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The power of nature is so great!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Afterwards, I invited them to the Yuxu Palace for a chat. The three of us got along well and made a vow under the moon to become sworn brothers.</font>
story_76245_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >No need to blame yourself! Your skills are not enough to harm me.</font>
story_76245_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hahaha, but you came at the right time. I have a request for my sworn brother in Kunlun. My sworn brother promised to give me these few things, and as long as you find them, I will forgive you.</font>
story_76246_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Not bad, not bad! I know that when I used three layers of power to compete with you on the mountain, you must not have been convinced. Are you interested in another competition?</font>
story_76247_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hahaha, no need to thank me. After all, I didn't even make a move.</font>
story_76247_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My purpose for this trip is to invite Brother Yunyang to travel to Tianya Haige, but unfortunately he has important responsibilities. He did ask me to bring you down the mountain for some experience, I wonder if you are interested?</font>
story_76247_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have other important matters to attend to, so I won't bother you any longer. If you are interested in traveling together, you can say goodbye to Brother Yunyang and come to Tianya Haige, where someone will receive you.</font>
story_76248_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have been practicing in the sect for some time now, it's time to go down the mountain and gain some experience. The path of martial arts is full of obstacles, but you must always stay true to yourself!</font>
story_76249_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Great hero... please spare us! We were just following orders from the innkeeper!</font>
story_76250_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, young hero, please come in! Are you just passing through or will you be staying at the inn?</font>
story_76250_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Huh? Sir, aren't we gentlemen who use our mouths instead of our hands? I don't know how I offended you, but even if I get beaten, I understand, right?</font>
story_76250_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's true that I was the one who called the man here, but that old man has been living off of me for three months. Are you here to pick him up? What about the rent for this room?</font>
story_76251_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The young master is indeed generous</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, I'll make arrangements. But let me remind you, we searched through all of the old man's belongings and didn't find anything valuable.</font>
story_76252_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for saving my life, young hero! You can call me Old Wang. But why do you care about a useless person like me who is already halfway into the grave?</font>
story_76252_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Alas, if only I had met someone like you, how could I have ended up like this...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ahem, ahem...cough, cough...</font>
story_76253_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Saving lives and helping the injured is our duty, where is the patient now?</font>
story_76254_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir, what can I do for you?</font>
story_76254_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir, you've come to the right person. There is an old doctor not far from here, on the west side of the Jinling Prefectural Government, who is well-known throughout the city of Jinling! I heard that the shopkeeper's wife...</font>
story_76255_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Alas...the odds are not in our favor...</font>
story_76255_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He has been wandering at sea for many years, and has a hidden illness in his heart. Coupled with the accumulation of stagnant qi, it is difficult to dissipate. Recently, he has also encountered physical attacks... sigh</font>
story_76256_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young hero, I heard everything you said just now. I know my time is limited, but unfortunately I have nothing valuable to repay you with.</font>
story_76256_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hahaha... cough... You are too kind, young hero. I have lived a life of luxury and happiness, but also experienced days of hardship where I couldn't even have a hot meal. There is only one regret...</font>
story_76256_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I was from Tianyou Island of South Sea. This was supposed to be my last voyage, but I was deceived by someone with ill intentions and lost all my savings. However, those are just material possessions and not important.</font>
story_76256_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What is important is my daughter! I set out on this voyage to find the five-colored pearls for my daughter! If she wears them, even the rainbows in the sky will pale in comparison.</font>
story_76256_5=Fortunately, the colorful pearl was not taken by the evil person. I hid it under the big tree outside the inn. If you can bring it to my daughter, I will be extremely grateful! If you are unwilling, then consider it as my repayment to you! My daughter's name is Wang... (Wang Lao passed away before finishing his words)
story_76257_1=Please accept my condolences!
story_76257_2=You can rest assured, young hero. I hope you have a safe journey!
story_76258_1=Are you also heading to the South Sea? That's great, I heard it's been turbulent there lately, with frequent pirate attacks. You seem to be a skilled warrior, and with you by my side, I feel much more at ease!
story_76259_1=We can only do this for now.
story_76260_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Have you also encountered pirates?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Qing the Great Hero has already taken people to attack the pirates. You seem to be injured, so sit down and rest for a while. Qing the Great Hero is highly skilled, and I believe he will return victorious soon!</font>
story_76261_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0522" >(With a look of intoxication, as if waking from a dream)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's exactly the same as it was back then...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You little rascal,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >how did you manage to do it?</font>
story_76261_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Could it be that the Dragon City Mirage is related to this extraordinary stone?</font>
story_76261_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >And how do you explain the silver galaxy-like scene on the coast?</font>
story_76261_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I see.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >After seeing this amazing sight,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yunhen remained silent for a long time, and I imagine his heart was also greatly shaken.</font>
story_76262_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These years have been too paranoid for me. A moment's mistake, but there is no turning back.</font>
story_76262_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have found my original intention, and from now on, I will return to my original self.</font>
story_76263_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tianyou Island!? Why are you asking about it?</font>
story_76263_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sigh...the old Wang family is really pitiful.</font>
story_76263_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You don't know, this old Wang! He has been out to sea for many years, with no news, and his wife cries facing the sea every day. The villagers tried to persuade her, but after a long time, her body couldn't take it anymore...sigh</font>
story_76263_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >After taking care of her mother's affairs, his daughter set sail with a merchant ship to find her father. However... they encountered pirates shortly after setting sail. According to the villagers who escaped, she chose to drown herself in the sea rather than be violated by the pirates.</font>
story_76264_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Just a short distance from the village, there is a tomb built by the villagers for their daughter.</font>
story_76265_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am Qinghe. You traveled thousands of miles just to fulfill a father's last wish. I admire you!</font>
story_76266_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't misunderstand, I heard your conversation with the grandma while you were resting. But I was afraid you were a pirate, so I secretly followed you here. When I saw you burying the priceless multicolored pearls by the grave, I could confirm that you are not a pirate. I admire your sense of righteousness!</font>
story_76267_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hahaha, you have good eyes. I am a disciple of the Tianya Haige Pavilion, and it is truly fate that we meet. Would you be interested in joining our Tianya Haige Pavilion for training?</font>
story_76268_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Not far from here, there is a spiritual turtle. Only those recognized by the turtle can join the Tianya Haige Pavilion.</font>
story_menu_76203=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The origin of Tianyou Island</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >……</font>
story_menu_76204=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Meet with your Elder Martial Sister</font>
story_menu_76205=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Using the art of medicine to understand human nature</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >……</font>
story_menu_76206=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Junior brother……</font>
story_menu_76207=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Elder,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the disciples in the sect have found a stranded ship on the coast.</font>
story_menu_76208=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Stranded ship</font>
story_menu_76209=Elder, we found four people unconscious outside a stranded ship. Judging from their clothing, there are three women besides the boatman.
story_menu_76210=Elder, the medicine is ready.
story_menu_76211=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Lady</font>
story_menu_76212=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Lady...</font>
story_menu_76213=(Finally, someone who speaks our language.) Young lady, may I ask where you all come from?
story_menu_76214=Reporting to the master, these few people who were stranded at sea have been saved by Elder Qingchuan and are now safe, but...
story_menu_76215=<font face="Default" color="#ff0515" >（Her body trembled slightly, looking a bit scared, but she maintained the same posture. Isn't she tired...?）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Miss, don't worry. The people here are peaceful and friendly, they won't harm you.</font>
story_menu_76216=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Miss</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, are you awake?</font>
story_menu_76217=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Miss Jade Rabbit</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, is your body feeling better?</font>
story_menu_76218=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings, Elder Yunhen</font>
story_menu_76219=<font face="Default" color="#f9002d" >（Seeing the strange expression on Jade Rabbit's face, felt puzzled）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Miss Jade Rabbit</font>
story_menu_76220=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Let's go take a look at that ship on the coast</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
story_menu_76221=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Golden Pearl and Silver Pearl, you two must know each other</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
story_menu_76222=Inquire about Elder Yunhen from Senior Brother Kongshan.
story_menu_76223=Senior Brother, there is one more matter.
story_menu_76224=Elder, there is something important to report...
story_menu_76225=Third Prince
story_menu_76226=Elder, (informing about the conversation with the third prince of the Tartars)
story_menu_76227=The elder has something to say, but it's okay to speak.
story_menu_76228=General Huang, the deployment map is confidential, I will find it as soon as possible
story_menu_76229=General Huang and Saihan, the ththird prince, have already left...
story_menu_76230=What happened after that...
story_menu_76231=This old lady looks unfamiliar.
story_menu_76232=Elder Yunhen, why are you so troubled?
story_menu_76233=Master, I have already visited Elder Yunhen...
story_menu_76234=Senior Sister, I need your help with something...
story_menu_76235=Grandma, I want to ask about the location where Miss Pearl had an accident...
story_menu_76236=Third Senior Sister, there are some things I would like to ask for your advice on.
story_menu_76237=Master, I have found a way to recreate the miraculous scene.
story_menu_76240=Please, Master, tell us!
story_menu_76241=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior Brother! I wonder what arrangements you have made during master's seclusion?</font>
story_menu_76242=Are you the leader?
story_menu_76243=Senior Wang? Big brother, why are you here?
story_menu_76244=Master!
story_menu_76245=Senior Wang, just now I...
story_menu_76246=Senior Wang, how is it?
story_menu_76247=It turns out that the purpose of your competition was to help me get rid of my inner demons! Thank you, senior!
story_menu_76248=Headmaster! I...
story_menu_76249=How does the taste of the fist the size of a sand pot?
story_menu_76250=Are you the shopkeeper?
story_menu_76251=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, I am here to find him. I paid the money he owed!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Also, I want a room upstairs, I will stay with him for half a month.</font>
story_menu_76252=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >May I know how to address you?</font>
story_menu_76253=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir, I have a friend who is seriously ill! I hope you can help treat him!</font>
story_menu_76254=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Waiter, come here.</font>
story_menu_76255=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir, how is my friend, is he seriously ill?</font>
story_menu_76256=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Mr. Wang...</font>
story_menu_76257=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir, Mr. Wang has passed away...</font>
story_menu_76258=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Captain</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, is this ship heading to the South Sea?</font>
story_menu_76259=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Captain, there are too many people on the other side. Let's retreat first, this island doesn't seem to be uninhabited. Maybe we can find some help!</font>
story_menu_76260=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Excuse me, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >we have encountered pirates! Is there anyone on the island who can help us?</font>
story_menu_76261=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >did you enjoy the show?</font>
story_menu_76262=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Elder Yun, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have achieved the Dragon City Mirage, you must also keep your promise and not have any thoughts of suicide.</font>
story_menu_76263=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Excuse me, do you know of a Tianyou Island in the South Sea?</font>
story_menu_76264=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Excuse me, do you know where the Wang family is buried? I want to pay my respects.</font>
story_menu_76265=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >May I ask why you are hiding behind the reef?</font>
story_menu_76266=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Could it be...?</font>
story_menu_76267=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Qing, your internal strength is deep and your breathing technique is not like that of Central Plains martial arts?</font>
story_menu_76268=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I don't know how to pass the review process.</font>
storyinfo_76203=Talk with <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Lord Youyou</a>
storyinfo_76204=Meet <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_007" style="HLStype1">Lord Yunhen</a>
storyinfo_76205=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_006" style="HLStype1">Lord Qingchuan</a> lecture on medicine and moral principles
storyinfo_76206=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_001" style="HLStype1">Yu Danli</a>
storyinfo_76207=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_006" style="HLStype1">Lord Qingchuan</a>
storyinfo_76208=Check the stranded <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_002" style="HLStype1">ship</a>
storyinfo_76209=Report to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_006" style="HLStype1">Lord Qingchuan</a>
storyinfo_76210=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_006" style="HLStype1">Lord Qingchuan</a>
storyinfo_76211=Inquire about the unconscious <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_008" style="HLStype1">woman</a>
storyinfo_76212=Inquire about the unconscious <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_009" style="HLStype1">woman</a>
storyinfo_76213=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_010" style="HLStype1">the unconscious woman</a>
storyinfo_76214=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>
storyinfo_76215=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_008" style="HLStype1">the golden pearl</a>
storyinfo_76216=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_009" style="HLStype1">the silver pearl</a>
storyinfo_76217=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_010" style="HLStype1">the jade rabbit</a>
storyinfo_76218=Encounter <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_012" style="HLStype1">Elder Yunhen</a> and bow in greeting
storyinfo_76219=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_011" style="HLStype1">the jade rabbit</a>
storyinfo_76220=Take another look at <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_002" style="HLStype1">the boat</a>
storyinfo_76221=Return to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_009" style="HLStype1">the group of girls</a>
storyinfo_76222=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_002" style="HLStype1">Senior Brother Kongshan</a> for advice
storyinfo_76223=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_002" style="HLStype1">Kongshan</a>
storyinfo_76224=Report to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>
storyinfo_76225=Disciples have come to report and <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_013" style="HLStype1">Saihan</a> has also arrived. Go to inquire
storyinfo_76226=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_015" style="HLStype1">Gezhu</a>
storyinfo_76227=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_014" style="HLStype1">Yunhen Elder</a>
storyinfo_76228=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_017" style="HLStype1">General Huang</a>
storyinfo_76229=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>
storyinfo_76230=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a> tell the story
storyinfo_76231=Encounter <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_019" style="HLStype1">Grandma Rong</a> and talk with her
storyinfo_76232=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_020" style="HLStype1">Yunhen Elder</a>
storyinfo_76233=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>
storyinfo_76234=Seek help from <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_003" style="HLStype1">Senior Sister Xue Xu</a>
storyinfo_76235=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,tyhgzyb_new_019" style="HLStype1">Grandma Rong</a>'s story
storyinfo_76236=Next, ask for help from <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_010" style="HLStype1">Third Senior Sister Zhou Si</a>
storyinfo_76237=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>
storyinfo_76240=Inquire with the <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">Headmaster</a> about the purpose of this summons
storyinfo_76241=Ask Senior Brother <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_01" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a> about his arrangements
storyinfo_76242=Question the <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_02" style="HLStype1">leader</a>
storyinfo_76243=Senior Brother seems to call someone "Senior Wang". Ask Senior Brother <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_05" style="HLStype1">Cao Yi'an</a> about this person's background.
storyinfo_76244=The <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">headmaster</a> has not yet closed his door and is catching up with Wang Fuhai in the Yuxu Hall. He summons you to the Yuxu Hall
storyinfo_76245=Apologize to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_06" style="HLStype1">Senior Wang</a>
storyinfo_76246=Talk to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_12" style="HLStype1">Wang Fuhai</a>.
storyinfo_76247=Having overcome the inner demons, return to Kunlun and find <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_12" style="HLStype1">Wang Fuhai</a> (leave <a href="findnpc,adv101,741,137,-68" style="HLStype1">Kunlun Summit</a>).
storyinfo_76248=Say goodbye to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,newmp_kl_001" style="HLStype1">the headmaster</a>.
storyinfo_76249=Question <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_17" style="HLStype1">the ruffian</a> why he beat the old man.
storyinfo_76250=Question <a href="findnpc_new,city03,jl117" style="HLStype1">the innkeeper</a> why he ordered someone to beat the old man.
storyinfo_76251=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,city03,jl117" style="HLStype1">the innkeeper</a>'s story
storyinfo_76252=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_19" style="HLStype1">the old man</a> how he feels (room on the second floor of the inn)
storyinfo_76253=Find <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_31" style="HLStype1">the doctor</a>
storyinfo_76254=In Jinling City, it's better to ask <a href="findnpc_new,city03,jl016" style="HLStype1">the waiter</a> where there is a famous doctor
storyinfo_76255=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_20" style="HLStype1">the doctor</a> (room on the second floor of the inn)
storyinfo_76256=I don't know if <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_19" style="HLStype1">Wang Lao</a> still has any relatives
storyinfo_76257=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_31" style="HLStype1">the doctor</a> to help bury Wang Lao
storyinfo_76258=Go to <a href="findnpc_new,city03,npc_ty_dy_22" style="HLStype1">the west pier of the city</a>, go to the South Sea
storyinfo_76259=Discuss strategies with <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_24" style="HLStype1">the captain</a>
storyinfo_76260=Find <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_25" style="HLStype1">the residents</a> on the island for help
storyinfo_76261=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_001" style="HLStype1">Youyou Jun</a>
storyinfo_76262=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_tyhg_007" style="HLStype1">Yunhen Jun</a>.
storyinfo_76263=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_25" style="HLStype1">Grandma Rong</a> about Tianyou Island
storyinfo_76264=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_25" style="HLStype1">Grandma Rong</a> about the Wang Family Cemetery
storyinfo_76265=There seems to be a <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_26" style="HLStype1">person</a> behind the reef
storyinfo_76266=Talk to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_26" style="HLStype1">Qing He</a>
storyinfo_76267=Talk to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_26" style="HLStype1">Qing He</a>
storyinfo_76268=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,city02,npc_tianya_kyf_003" style="HLStype1">Jiang Danjin</a> talk about the requirements for joining Tianya Haige
storymenu_76203_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >No wonder the leader's face is like the moon on Mid-Autumn Festival, with extraordinary spirit. It turns out there is such a magical spring in the world!</font>
storymenu_76203_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Although the master is hidden, the legend of Tianya Haige has been circulating in the martial arts world... You possess unparalleled martial arts skills, yet have a peaceful and distant heart, which is admired by your disciples.</font>
storymenu_76203_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I understand.</font>
storymenu_76204_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, I have come to seek an audience with Elder Yunhen. Please  inform him.</font>
storymenu_76204_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have recently joined Tianya Haige and wish to meet Elder Yunhen. Do you know where he is? </font><font face="Default" color="#f40746" >(The senior sister in front of me is as beautiful as a heavenly maiden.)</font>
storymenu_76204_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I apologize for my impudence, Elder. Please do not be offended.</font>
storymenu_76205_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0515" >(It seems that this beautiful woman in front of me is the elder Qingchuan)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Nice to meet you, Elder Qingchuan</font>
storymenu_76205_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I listen attentively</font>
storymenu_76205_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Elder's words: bold, meticulous, upright, and wise</font>
storymenu_76206_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go and take a look now.</font>
storymenu_76207_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes.</font>
storymenu_76208_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Judging from the damage to this ship,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >it seems</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >that it encountered a big storm on the nearby sea. It's fortunate that it was able to run aground here</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >. If it were in the deep sea, it would have been eaten by sharks long ago... The four unconscious people on the ship still have a pulse, so there is still hope for them</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76209_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will make arrangements for them right away.</font>
storymenu_76210_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I will follow your order</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff">.</font>
storymenu_76211_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have no idea what she's saying</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'll go ask the other two girls!</font>
storymenu_76212_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What language is this... We can't communicate at all</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76213_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff050d" >(This girl's words are full of doubts... But let's not dwell on it for now)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I see, please rest here peacefully</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76214_1=<font face="Default" color="#ed0e2f" >(I can't believe you're the master of this place...)</font><font face="Default" color="#f40c3a" >But master, after inquiring, the disciple is doubtful of the identities of those women. They claim to be friends, but their language is clearly not understandable, and they are dressed extravagantly, not like ordinary people in the martial arts world.</font>
storymenu_76214_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes, master.</font>
storymenu_76215_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well, I give up trying to talk to you.</font><font face="Default" color="#f90c28" >(But upon closer observation, this girl, with her delicate skin and tender flesh, does not seem to come from an ordinary background.)</font>
storymenu_76216_1=<font face="Default" color="#f40c4a" >(This is giving me a headache.)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This girl and the one on the bed next to her seem to be together...</font>
storymenu_76217_1=<font face="Default" color="#ef0e37" >（The calluses on the hands of the Jade Rabbit girl are the marks left by holding the reins all year round. Although her skin is weathered, it is not as delicate as the other two, but she exudes a free and unrestrained aura. She doesn't seem like a servant, so her status in the North must not be low.）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Jade Rabbit, would you like to take a breath with me?</font>
storymenu_76218_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is Jade Rabbit. A few days ago, she encountered a shipwreck and was rescued by a disciple.</font>
storymenu_76219_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0a1a" >（Jade Rabbit seems quite excited. Does she know Elder Yunhen? Let me test her.）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's our Elder Yunhen from the End of the World Pavilion. Jade Rabbit, I have something to attend to, but I will come back to find you later.</font>
storymenu_76220_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Although this ship is not large, it is made from a whole piece of wood and is very sturdy. Upon closer inspection, it can be seen that the planks on both sides of the ship have been punctured with sharp tools, causing the ship to continuously take on water and lose balance... If what the Jade Rabbit said is true and they encountered a storm at sea, why is the mast of the ship still intact? It seems that their ship was intentionally "stranded" on Tianyou Island</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76221_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that Jinzhu and Yinzhu really can't understand</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >our language</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >... Let's go find the eldest senior brother</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and see if there are any other solutions</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76222_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I accidentally overheard a conversation between Elder Yunhen and the Jade Rabbit girl who was stranded here due to a shipwreck, and it turns out they are mother and daughter. The ship was also tampered with by someone and intentionally stranded on our island.</font>
storymenu_76222_2=<font face="Default" color="#ff051e" >(pondering)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tartar? Jade Rabbit... I seem to have some clues!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for informing me, senior brother.</font>
storymenu_76223_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I just received a homing pigeon letter from the third prince of Tartar, Saihan. The letter said that the princess of Tartar, Tulan, was ordered to go to Jinling for a marriage alliance, but suddenly went missing with the Korean tribute girl. Not only that, she also stole the military map of Ming Dynasty. I suspect...</font>
storymenu_76223_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >And</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the golden and silver beads are those two</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Korean tribute girls!</font>
storymenu_76223_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >All right.</font>
storymenu_76224_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font><font face="Default" color="#f4043c" >(revealing the true identities of Jade Rabbit and the golden and silver beads, and presenting the letter from the Tartar prince)</font>
storymenu_76224_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >However, Princess Tulai deliberately detoured to Tianyou Island. I am afraid that the court would think we were colluding with the Tartars. At that time, it would be difficult to explain.</font>
storymenu_76225_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your scruples are your own. I'm just glad you decided to spare us.</font>
storymenu_76225_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Third Prince, for explaining on our behalf. I will report this matter to the Prime Minister.</font>
storymenu_76226_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go and ask Elder Yunhen if he has something to say.</font>
storymenu_76227_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Princess Tulai is actually your daughter...</font>
storymenu_76227_2=Elder Yunhen, not everything in this world can be exchanged one for one. The princess has made a grave mistake, I'm afraid... (Huh? Where did Princess Tu go?)
storymenu_76228_1=In that case, once we find the military map, we will destroy it.
storymenu_76228_2=Thank you, General Huang.
storymenu_76229_1=General Huang has just informed me that the battle formation map has been stolen and even if it is retrieved, it will only be a useless piece of paper. After he returns, he will reorganize the military department and eliminate any internal issues...
storymenu_76229_2=Fate is unpredictable, who would have thought that the reunion of Princess Lai and Elder Yunhan would end up like this.
storymenu_76229_3=That period of time must have been the happiest days for the Sect Master and the two elders.
storymenu_76229_4=What is love in this world...
storymenu_76230_1=The Dragon City Mirage?
storymenu_76230_2=This phenomenon is too unbelievable!
storymenu_76230_3=In these past ten years, has Elder Yunhan... returned to the Tartar tribe?
storymenu_76230_4=I admire the Sect Master and Elder Qingchuan's broad-mindedness.
storymenu_76230_5=Sect Master, please do not worry, I am willing to go and visit on your behalf.
storymenu_76231_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Can grandma tell me about the girl? </font>
storymenu_76231_2=<font face="Default" color="#f4224c" >(Feeling very upset)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Pearl</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >girl</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >is really pitiful, and in the end she couldn't even see her father...</font>
storymenu_76231_3=<font face="Default" color="#f90227" >(This scene seems to match the strange phenomenon mentioned by the master, could there be some connection...)</font>
storymenu_76232_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since the dead cannot be brought back to life, the living must be stronger and carry on for them! Besides, Elder, you still have unresolved issues, don't you?</font>
storymenu_76232_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Everything has not changed, it's just that there is a lack of opportunity for you to be honest with each other. If I can recreate the Dragon City Mirage, can Elder Yunhan promise not to take her own life again, and try to have a good talk with the Sect Master and Elder Qingchuan?</font>
storymenu_76232_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Elder Yunhan, please wait patiently for good news.</font>
storymenu_76233_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >She attempted to take her own life, but was stopped by me... I made a promise with her to recreate the Dragon City Mirage as soon as possible.</font>
storymenu_76233_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sect Master, you can rest assured, I already have a plan in mind.</font>
storymenu_76233_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Absolutely not!</font><font face="Default" color="#f9002d" >(Sect Master, you are truly a lonely soul... Senior Sister has a lot of knowledge and experience, it's better to ask for her help.)</font>
storymenu_76234_1=Sister, do you know where the volcano near Tianyou Island is and what its characteristics are?
storymenu_76234_2=The golden shimmering peculiar stones?
storymenu_76234_3=Thank you for your guidance, Sister.
storymenu_76235_1=Is there a necessary connection between the golden stones, silver stones, and the peculiar scenery?
storymenu_76236_1=Why does putting the golden and silver stones into the fire produce golden smoke?
storymenu_76236_2=(It seems that these extraordinary stones played a crucial role in the wonders of that year.)
storymenu_76237_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please forgive me for now</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >maintaining</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >mystery. Tonight at 9:00, please invite two elders to wait at the seaside.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76240_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >is too kind!</font>
storymenu_76240_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">I obey the order.</font>
storymenu_76241_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh?! Could it be that you intend to do something improper to the dragon veins? Why don't I...</font>
storymenu_76241_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You mean?</font>
storymenu_76241_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">Deliver it to me!</font>
storymenu_76242_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Is the name of the sect leader something you can call directly like this?! Do you recognize this object?</font>
storymenu_76242_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Speaking more is useless! Watch out!</font>
storymenu_76243_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Could it be that I misunderstood him, but Senior Brother, look!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What is the explanation for this object?</font>
storymenu_76244_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >But the things inside the package</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
storymenu_76244_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I never expected such a feat from Senior Wang! So, is that package a gift from the people?</font>
storymenu_76244_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >However, there is one thing that I don't understand. Master  usually resides in Kunlun and rarely leaves, how did he develop such a deep relationship with someone like Senior Wang?</font>
storymenu_76244_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So, Master and Senior Wang, as well as the leader of Tianya Haige, are sworn brothers! It must have been a thrilling experience when they joined forces to fight against the avalanche!</font>
storymenu_76244_5=My senior brother once told me that our master had two sworn brothers who formed the Three Sons of the End of the World! I apologize to Senior Wang for this disciple's behavior!
storymenu_76245_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Elder...</font>
storymenu_76245_2=I wonder what Senior Wang is seeking?
storymenu_76246_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please teach me. </font>
storymenu_76247_1=(scratches head)
storymenu_76247_2=The End of the World Pavilion?
storymenu_76247_3=Senior, please take care!
storymenu_76248_1=I will remember this! Master, take care!
storymenu_76249_1=Hmph! If you dare to deceive me...
storymenu_76250_1=Haha! I won't just talk, I'll fight!
storymenu_76250_2=You were the one who instructed the thugs to beat up the old man at the door?
storymenu_76250_3=I...
storymenu_76251_1=Don't waste time, quickly arrange a room!
storymenu_76252_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wang Lao, the saying goes that it is better to live than to die. Our actions in the jianghu are all about righteousness and chivalry. What is a mere few taels of silver compared to a human life?</font>
storymenu_76252_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wang Lao</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, the story can be told slowly. I will go and find a doctor for you!</font>
storymenu_76253_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >He is currently resting at an inn in the city.</font>
storymenu_76254_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Let me ask you, where in Jinling City can we find a famous doctor?</font>
storymenu_76254_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Alright, I'll take my leave now!</font>
storymenu_76255_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Huh? What do you mean by that?</font>
storymenu_76255_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you so much, sir! Have a safe journey!</font>
storymenu_76256_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wang Lao, do you think I am helping you for some ulterior motive?</font>
storymenu_76256_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What regrets does Wang Lao have? If I can be of any help...</font>
storymenu_76256_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Then what is the most important thing?</font>
storymenu_76256_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure it must be so!</font>
storymenu_76256_5=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wang Lao!</font>
storymenu_76257_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Before leaving, Mr. Wang asked me to help him with something. I must not delay and prepare to leave immediately. Here is some money, please take care of Mr. Wang's affairs after his passing, sir!</font>
storymenu_76257_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">Goodbye!</font>
storymenu_76258_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What a coincidence.</font>
storymenu_76259_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hurry up!</font>
storymenu_76260_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I hope so!</font>
storymenu_76261_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure the master has heard of the story of the pearl girl on the island. The fleet sank because of encountering pirates, and all the extraordinary stones were dumped into the sea.</font>
storymenu_76261_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Not bad. At that time, there was a volcanic eruption nearby, which caused a large amount of extraordinary stone to be produced, and the interaction between the two resulted in a golden mist that covered the sky, giving rise to the Dragon City Mirage. Later, the golden mist turned into rain and fell down, appearing as if it was a golden rain shower.</font>
storymenu_76261_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The "golden rain" fell into the sea, and coincidentally, a school of fish passed by. Their bodies began to glow, but when they accidentally touched the seawater containing extraordinary stone, they were in great pain. After being washed ashore by the tide, they would struggle desperately, and the glowing bands were formed as a result.</font>
storymenu_76261_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'll visit her</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76262_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The past cannot be changed, but the future can still be pursued. Let time heal the wounds of the past</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76262_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Pavilion Master and Elder Qingchuan will be happy for you when they find out</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_76263_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Grandmother, please don't misunderstand, I am not a pirate! Is this Tianyou Island? I was entrusted by an old man named Wang Yang to find his daughter. He is in Jinling...</font>
storymenu_76263_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Pity? I don't understand. </font>
storymenu_76263_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What a tragic man, where is his daughter?!</font>
storymenu_76263_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!!!</font>
storymenu_76264_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Grandmother!</font>
storymenu_76265_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Are you the Qing Daxia mentioned by Grandmother? Why are you hiding behind the reef?</font>
storymenu_76266_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sigh...just helping an old father fulfill his wish.</font>
storymenu_76267_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This place is isolated from the world, it is indeed a good place for cultivation.</font>
storymenu_76268_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff">So that is what it is!</font>
useiteminfo_76201=Go to <a href="findnpc_new,school25,eventnpc_tyhgzyb_001" style="HLStype1">the Fountain of Youth</a> and use <a href="TASK_ITEM,useItem_tyhgzyb_001" style="HLStype1">the Water Bottle</a> to collect the water from the Fountain of Youth.
useiteminfo_76202=Grind <a href="TASK_ITEM,useItem_tyhgzyb_003" style="HLStype1">tea leaves</a>.
useiteminfo_76203=Prepare <a href="TASK_ITEM,useItem_tyhgzyb_004" style="HLStype1">tea powder</a>
useiteminfo_76204=See what's in the <a href="TASK_ITEM,useitem_ty_dy_01" style="HLStype1">package</a>
useiteminfo_76205=Use a <a href="TASK_ITEM,useitem_ty_dy_02" style="HLStype1">torch</a> to keep warm
useiteminfo_76206=Bury <a href="TASK_ITEM,useitem_ty_dy_04" style="HLStype1">colorful pearls</a> next to a <a href="findnpc_new,school25,npc_ty_dy_27" style="HLStype1">grave</a>
useiteminfo_76207=Feed a <a href="TASK_ITEM,useitem_ty_dy_05" style="HLStype1">fresh fish</a> to the <a href="findnpc_new,city02,npc_ty_dy_29" style="HLStype1">spirit turtle</a> and gain approval (ask Jiang Danjin for a fresh fish)

